{"seq":1,"slug":"regulatory-content-compliance-rules","title":"跨境商品内容合规规则建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/compliance-validation-quality/regulatory-content-compliance-rules","wordCount":2661,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境商品内容合规规则建模\">跨境商品内容合规规则建模</h1><p>一件儿童连帽衫要在欧盟售卖，listing 上必须出现欧盟境内责任人的名称与地址；卖到美国，进口报关时要向 CBP 电子提交合规证书（16 CFR Part 1110，最终规则 2025 年 1 月 8 日发布，生效日 2026 年 7 月 8 日，来源：<a href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/01/08/2024-30826/certificates-of-compliance\">Federal Register 2024-30826</a>）。合规要求从不写在 feed 规范里——Google 的商品数据规范只告诉你 <code>title</code> 上限 150 字符，不会告诉你这个标题在德国必须能支撑一条德语警示语。把这些要求从「法务的表格 + 运营的记忆」搬成可版本化、可回归、可审计的规则集，就是<strong>合规规则建模</strong>要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把合规写成规则而不是代码\">核心概念：把合规写成规则而不是代码</h2><p>跨境合规内容有三条独立的变更流，混淆它们是这一层最常见的架构错误。<strong>法域法规</strong>以年为单位改（GPSR 自 2024 年 12 月 13 日起适用，来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">General Product Safety Regulation</a>）；<strong>渠道政策</strong>以季度改（Google 自 2025 年 4 月起要求需要能源标签的欧盟商品改用 <code>certification</code> 属性登记 EPREL 编号，来源：<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112\">Google 商品数据规范</a>）；<strong>商品属性</strong>以天改。规则建模把三者解耦：法规提供判据，渠道提供字段落点，商品提供被检验的值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[法域法规库&lt;br/&gt;GPSR / DSA / CPSC / 能源标签] --&gt; D[合规规则集&lt;br/&gt;rule set]&#10;  B[渠道政策&lt;br/&gt;required &amp; display attributes] --&gt; D&#10;  C[商品主数据&lt;br/&gt;PIM attributes] --&gt; E{规则求值引擎}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  F[目标市场&lt;br/&gt;market + locale] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|block| G[拒发 / 阻断上架]&#10;  E --&gt;|warn| H[警告并放行]&#10;  E --&gt;|pass| I[进入 feed 构建]&#10;  E --&gt; J[证据台账&lt;br/&gt;evidence ledger]\">graph TD\n  A[法域法规库&lt;br/&gt;GPSR / DSA / CPSC / 能源标签] --&gt; D[合规规则集&lt;br/&gt;rule set]\n  B[渠道政策&lt;br/&gt;required &amp; display attributes] --&gt; D\n  C[商品主数据&lt;br/&gt;PIM attributes] --&gt; E{规则求值引擎}\n  D --&gt; E\n  F[目标市场&lt;br/&gt;market + locale] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|block| G[拒发 / 阻断上架]\n  E --&gt;|warn| H[警告并放行]\n  E --&gt;|pass| I[进入 feed 构建]\n  E --&gt; J[证据台账&lt;br/&gt;evidence ledger]</pre><p>规则集与映射规则集（见<a href=\"../feed-build-transform/feed-schema-field-mapping\">Feed Schema 建模与字段映射规则</a>）必须分开，因为失败语义不同：映射错误让字段为空，合规错误让商品<strong>违法</strong>——后者是要下架、要出报告的事件，需要自己的严重度、证据与留存策略。二者共用「规则即数据」的手段，但服务不同的验收方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>映射规则</th>\n<th>合规规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判据来源</td>\n<td>渠道字段规范</td>\n<td>法域法规 + 渠道政策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败后果</td>\n<td>字段缺失 / 被拒审</td>\n<td>违法、下架、行政责任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据要求</td>\n<td>无需留存</td>\n<td>必须可举证、可审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"合规规则的三种冲突面-属地-渠道-品类\">合规规则的三种冲突面：属地、渠道、品类</h2><p>同一条商品内容要同时满足三个正交切面的要求，而它们经常互相矛盾。建模的第一步是把它们做成规则的**作用域（scope）**维度，而不是揉进一个巨大的 <code>if</code> 链。</p>\n<p><strong>属地切面</strong>决定「谁的信息、用什么语言」。FTC 的 Made in USA 规则（16 CFR Part 323，2021 年 8 月定稿）采用「all or virtually all」标准，线上目录与邮件订购材料中的印章式标注同样受限，来源：<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/complying-made-usa-standard\">FTC Made in USA 指南</a>；欧盟方向则要求列出责任人且警示语使用目的地成员国语言。同一件商品可能一边要标注「组装于美国」，一边要标注欧盟责任人——两条独立规则，不能共用字段。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道切面</strong>决定「落在哪个字段上」。欧盟《数字服务法》（DSA，Regulation (EU) 2022/2065）第 30 条要求在线平台在允许商家上架前取得其名称、地址、电话、邮箱、身份证件、支付账户与商业登记信息，并让身份/联系方式、登记信息和合规自我声明<strong>显示在商品页上</strong>；2024 年 2 月 17 日前已在平台的商家有 12 个月过渡期，即 2025 年 2 月 17 日起未补齐者须被暂停，来源：<a href=\"https://www.eu-digital-services-act.com/Digital_Services_Act_Article_30.html\">DSA Article 30</a>。这类要求的落点是「商户级属性」，不属于商品主数据。</p>\n<p><strong>品类切面</strong>决定「对哪些商品生效」。能源标签只覆盖受监管品类，要求在线销售时在价格附近清晰显示能效标签（完整标签或能效等级箭头）并链接到标签与产品信息表；供应商须在商品进入欧盟市场前把每个型号登记进 EPREL 取得注册号，来源：<a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/business/product-requirements/labels-markings/energy-labels/index_en.htm\">Your Europe 能源标签</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则模型-作用域-判据-证据-时效\">规则模型：作用域、判据、证据、时效</h2><p>一条合规规则可形式化为五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = (S,\\ p,\\ \\sigma,\\ e,\\ \\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：作用域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、判据（谓词）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、严重度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>、证据类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>、有效期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。对给定的 <code>(item, channel, market)</code> 三元组，<strong>生效规则集</strong>是作用域匹配且处于有效期内的规则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>scope</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> valid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{*}(x, ch, mkt) = \\{\\, r \\in R \\mid \\text{scope}(r.S, x, ch, mkt) \\ \\land\\ \\text{valid}(r.\\tau, t_{\\text{now}}) \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>判定规则是「存在任一阻断级规则被违反则阻断」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>verdict</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>BLOCK</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>block</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>WARN</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>warn</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>PASS</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{verdict}(x, ch, mkt) = \\begin{cases} \\text{BLOCK} &amp; \\exists r \\in R^{*}:\\ \\neg p_r(x) \\land \\sigma_r = \\text{block} \\\\ \\text{WARN} &amp; \\exists r \\in R^{*}:\\ \\neg p_r(x) \\land \\sigma_r = \\text{warn} \\\\ \\text{PASS} &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">verdict</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size